      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Not all the 3 suppliers who responded to our Solar Quotes enquiry quoted what we thought we wanted, e.g. \"you don't need a Fronius Primo inverter, the one we are quoting is good and much cheaper\" and \"you don't need a 6+kW system as you can only supply 5kW to the grid\" etc.  None of those suppliers suggested (or provided us with the \"Solar Provider's Statement\" required by Solar Vic for rebate eligibility - whilst they might have thought we were too late we actually did apply and received our eligibility the day it closed and none have followed up to ascertain if we had made a decision, we thought that rather strange or maybe they have plenty of business).  Breaze realised we were close to cutoff and sent through the Solar Provider's Statement and we successfully applied.",
