      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Breaze is actually on your website, so there wasn't an appropriate answer to Q2. Simon and Karl at Breaze in Ballarat are very professional, enthusiastic and knowledgeable about all aspects of solar - PV systems, hot water systems including evacuated tubes, heat pumps etc - and are extremely helpful. They answered all my many queries almost immediately, and Karl came out to my place several times to discuss the best options for my situation, measure the roof, check the electrical wiring etc. And then he came out to help Philip, the electrician, with the installation as well. He couldn't have been more helpful and enthusiastic. My house isn't even finished yet, but my PV system is already on the roof, and up and running! I highly recommend Breaze. You couldn't find a better company.",
